  )
  (text
    "1. Set P110 output latch LOW.\n2. Configure P110 as an output.\n3. Check ADC, PGD and firmware state.\n4. Set P110 HIGH to request both rails ON.\nAny firmware STOP sets P110 LOW."
    (at 276.86 152.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "f84471f6-9fb2-5ea2-ae0d-3795d24bbc28")
  )
  (text
    "ADC: 3.2V/cell stop; 3.4V/cell permits recovery.\nEach LM5060 still waits for its own UVLO ON threshold.\nnPGD_3S and nPGD_6S are independent status inputs."
    (at 17.78 203.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "ff337dfc-19d9-5d86-8118-3da88a6dd28e")
  )
  (text
    "ADC14: AN000..AN003, analog mode, digital buffers OFF. Use actual reference calibration and a sampling time suited to 3.873k source impedance."
    (at 17.78 228.6 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "b4937e32-7706-5e83-9f0e-527293b9435b")
  )
  (text
    "No current measurement. No added ADC-side pulldowns. No added MCU_RUN pulldown. Unused GPIO are explicitly marked NC."
    (at 17.78 238.76 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "cbe6d53f-f64e-55e0-a7ff-32c57b187750")
  )
  (text
    "Firmware defines time filtering, recovery delay, fault retry and display content. See docs/MCU_PIN_ASSIGNMENT.csv."
    (at 17.78 248.92 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "a8689a0d-0b26-56d8-a25f-50a83f94140f")
  )
